DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41863::$$$message_0228_0000_0000$$$::"Our Master took the first bath, but this is one hell of a vacation!"::
41864::$$$message_0228_0000_0001$$$::"Good wine, good food, and I can see the stars!"::
41865::$$$message_0228_0000_0002$$$::"Why do I have to share a room with a big man and a morally bankrupt nun... I wish I could've come here with Yukika..."::
41866::$$$message_0228_0000_0003$$$::"Aw, don't look so down, pervy kid![lr]::
41867::$$$message_0228_0000_0004$$$::It's a company retreat! Drink up!"::
41868::$$$message_0228_0000_0005$$$::"Lancer, please do not offer alcohol to minors."::
41869::$$$message_0228_0000_0006$$$::"Oh, that does sound like something a clergywoman would say. Did the bath cleanse your wicked heart?"::
41870::$$$message_0228_0000_0007$$$::"This is not a moral objection.[lr]::
41871::$$$message_0228_0000_0008$$$::I'm worried that the side effects of the alcohol might turn him back into an adult."::
41872::$$$message_0228_0000_0009$$$::"Absolutely not!"::
41873::$$$message_0228_0000_0010$$$::"This is my first time trying nihonshu. Let's see, the maker is Kameido..."::
41874::$$$message_0228_0000_0011$$$::"Oh shit, kid! I just realized something crazy!"::
41875::$$$message_0228_0001_0000$$$::"Listen, if you add 'me' to Kameido, you get...wait for it... Mecha Maid!"::
41876::$$$message_0228_0001_0001$$$::"...Nature really does win out over nurture.[lr]::
41877::$$$message_0228_0001_0002$$$::Lancer, it seems you're a moron no matter who your Master is."::
41878::$$$message_0228_0001_0003$$$::"The hell was that!? Where'd your verbal filter go today!? I won't give you anything, even if you gas me up!"::
41879::$$$message_0228_0001_0004$$$::"Ugh, this is why I detest drunkards!"::
41880::$$$message_0228_0001_0005$$$::"...My, you're both so spirited.[se storage=se045.wav][lr]::
41881::$$$message_0228_0001_0006$$$::We did achieve our goal, so I suppose we have a right to enjoy this."::
41882::$$$message_0228_0001_0007$$$::"...Still, to let them slip through our grasp when we were one step away...[lr]::
41883::$$$message_0228_0001_0008$$$::It seems I still have much to learn."::
41884::$$$message_0228_0001_0009$$$::"Huh. You're oddly cheerful, given that Kotomine had his way with you."::
41885::$$$message_0228_0001_0010$$$::"Why wouldn't she be? She's a literal masochist."::
41886::$$$message_0228_0001_0011$$$::"..."::
41887::$$$message_0228_0001_0012$$$::"Yeah.[lr]::
41888::$$$message_0228_0001_0013$$$::I meant to hide it, but if I'm being honest, I'm overjoyed."::
41889::$$$message_0228_0001_0014$$$::"After all...I get to stay at this luxurious resort for free. I'm glad that my Servant is so hardworking and financially responsible."::
41890::$$$message_0228_0001_0015$$$::"Wha?"::
41891::$$$message_0228_0001_0016$$$::"My, didn't I mention it?[lr]::
41892::$$$message_0228_0001_0017$$$::I used Lancer's hidden savings to pay for our stay here."::
41893::$$$message_0228_0001_0018$$$::"Your account balance is a perfect zero.[lr]::
41894::$$$message_0228_0001_0019$$$::I hope you'll keep devoting yourself to your labors."::
41895::$$$message_0228_0001_0020$$$::"Wh[line len=2][wait canskip=0 time=300]This ain't no company retreat if I have to pick up the whole bill!"::
41896::$$$message_0228_0001_0021$$$::"It's [font italic=true]my[font italic=false] retreat.[lr]::
41897::$$$message_0228_0001_0022$$$::No one said you were included."::
41898::$$$message_0228_0001_0023$$$::"Buogh!"::
41899::$$$message_0228_0001_0024$$$::"Savings? What savings!? That's the salary I literally got paid yesterday!"::
41900::$$$message_0228_0001_0025$$$::"A month's hard work... Gone in a day!"::
41901::$$$message_0228_0001_0026$$$::"Oh, I didn't realize. I apologize.[lr]::
41902::$$$message_0228_0001_0027$$$::Keep it up, Lancer."::
41903::$$$message_0228_0001_0028$$$::"...Yeah.[lr]::
41904::$$$message_0228_0001_0029$$$::I figured that's what this was all along."[nolr]:¡¹